flowchart TD
  L[Closest-work and data audit] --> R[Reproduce strong baselines]
  R --> T[Test daily signal against same-feature methods]
  T -->|No incremental effect| S[Stop or justify separate empirical contribution]
  T -->|Repeatable useful effect| V[Freeze protocol and validate]
  V -->|Fails transfer| F[Report limits and reconsider]
  V -->|Survives| M[Develop bounded methodological contribution]
